#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:9
msgid "平台如何装配和运行"
msgstr "How the platform is assembled and runs"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:11
msgid ""
"Nexus 是静态装配的 C11 MCU "
"平台。构建期选定硬件与容量，运行期保留真实设备状态和借用。应用取得只读接口后，直接调用选定实现；Platform 负责装配与生命周期。"
msgstr ""
"Nexus is a statically assembled C11 MCU platform. Hardware and capacity are "
"selected at build time; runtime retains actual device state and loans. "
"Applications obtain read-only interfaces and call the selected "
"implementation directly; Platform owns assembly and lifecycle."

