#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:28
msgid ""
"Core 不依赖 Arch、SoC 或 OS；I/O 依赖 Core。Provider 依赖公共 I/O、Core、Arch 和私有厂商 "
"SDK。组件通过公共端口访问设备，OS 不成为每次 I/O 的强制中间层。"
msgstr ""
"Core does not depend on Arch, SoC or OS; I/O depends on Core. Providers "
"depend on public I/O, Core, Arch and a private vendor SDK. Components access"
" devices through public ports. An OS is not a mandatory intermediary for "
"each I/O call."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:30
msgid "构建期连接"
msgstr "Build-time connections"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:32
msgid ""
"一份 schema-2 TOML 表达应用选择，SoC 与 Board JSON "
"提供已审事实。解析器校验模式、时钟、pin、IRQ、DMA、内存域和预算，冻结为具名不可变 IR，再原子生成配置、静态实例、factory "
"和固定连接。CMake 拥有唯一翻译单元与软件依赖图。"
msgstr ""
"One schema-2 TOML expresses application choices; SoC and Board JSON supply "
"reviewed facts. The resolver validates modes, clocks, pins, IRQ, DMA, memory"
" domains and budgets, freezes named immutable IR, and atomically generates "
"configuration, static instances, factory and fixed connections. CMake owns "
"the single translation-unit and software dependency graph."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:34
msgid "![配置与原子生成](../assets/diagrams/configuration-generation.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Configuration and atomic generation](../assets/diagrams/configuration-"
"generation.svg)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:34
msgid "配置与原子生成"
msgstr "Configuration and atomic generation"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:36
msgid ""
"Board 和 SoC 不包含 Python 插件。通用主机工具只做校验与静态连接；硬件顺序、等待、回读、回滚和恢复直接用 C 实现。包、binding"
" 与导出边界见[接入合同](../reference/contracts/integration.md)。"
msgstr ""
"Board and SoC packages contain no Python plugins. Common host tools only "
"validate and connect static objects; hardware ordering, waits, readback, "
"rollback and recovery are implemented directly in C. See the [integration "
"contract](../reference/contracts/integration.md) for package, binding and "
"export boundaries."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:38
msgid "运行期访问"
msgstr "Runtime access"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:40
msgid ""
"一个 controller 行为域只有一个 live owner。endpoint、GPIO view、逻辑 signal 和可选 face "
"引用已有资源，不再取得一份硬件所有权。每类实现共享只读 `ops`，每实例独立持有 `context`。"
msgstr ""
"A controller behavior domain has one live owner. Endpoints, GPIO views, "
"logical signals and optional faces reference existing resources rather than "
"acquiring another hardware ownership. Each implementation class shares read-"
"only `ops`; each instance independently holds its `context`."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:42
msgid ""
"factory 按生成的强类型 ID 返回已有静态 face，不分配、不初始化、不探测设备。Platform 显式启动基础设施，不启动 "
"scheduler。应用提供请求、buffer、执行者和等待；普通同步操作不承担未选择的队列、stream 或 OS 状态。"
msgstr ""
"Factory lookup uses generated strong IDs to return existing static faces "
"without allocation, initialization or discovery. Platform explicitly starts "
"infrastructure, not the scheduler. The application supplies requests, "
"buffers, executors and waiting. Ordinary synchronous operations do not carry"
" unselected queue, stream or OS state."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:44
msgid "![静态 factory 与实例](../assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)"
msgstr ""
"![Static factory and instances](../assets/diagrams/factory-instances.svg)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:44
msgid "静态 factory 与实例"
msgstr "Static factory and instances"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:46
msgid ""
"ACCEPTED 后请求和数据持续被借用，直到 acquire 观察 SETTLED。DMA "
"完成、线上完成和引用撤回分别证明；取消或超时不授权提前复用。观察者、控制 handle、通知发布者和 owner 还需完成各自的 "
"join。见[所有权](ownership.md)。"
msgstr ""
"After ACCEPTED, the request and data remain borrowed until SETTLED is "
"acquire-observed. DMA completion, wire completion and reference withdrawal "
"require separate proof. Cancellation or timeout does not authorize early "
"reuse. Observers, control handles, notification publishers and owners must "
"also complete their respective joins. See [ownership](ownership.md)."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:48
msgid "启动、失败与停机"
msgstr "Startup, failure and shutdown"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:50
msgid ""
"Platform 先完成所选控制器的准入，再对 System、共享资源和控制器执行有序启动。 中途失败按已经产生的效果逆序撤回；撤回失败继续保留原 "
"owner、存储和恢复责任， 错误返回不表示硬件已经静默。"
msgstr ""
"Platform first completes admission for the selected controllers, then starts"
" System, shared resources and controllers in order. A failure partway "
"through withdraws actual effects in reverse order. Failed withdrawal retains"
" the original owner, storage and recovery responsibilities; an error return "
"does not imply that hardware is quiescent."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:54
msgid ""
"应用在停机前关闭新工作、推进已接受请求结清，并退出相关任务和观察者。 Platform 再停止所选基础设施；它不替应用终止调度器或提前回收借用存储。"
msgstr ""
"Before shutdown, the application closes new work, advances accepted requests"
" to settlement, and joins the relevant tasks and observers. Platform then "
"stops the selected infrastructure. It does not terminate the application "
"scheduler or reclaim borrowed storage early."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:57
msgid "![显式启动、停机与失败撤回](../assets/diagrams/platform-lifecycle.svg)"
msgstr ""
