"withdrawal](../assets/diagrams/platform-lifecycle.svg)"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:57
msgid "显式启动、停机与失败撤回"
msgstr "Explicit startup, shutdown and failure withdrawal"

