#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:66
msgid ""
"每个构建目录只含一个工具链和装配，Runtime 与 Platform 互斥。同一装配可创建多个镜像，各镜像独立拥有 startup "
"OBJECT。不同板卡或 CPU/安全域使用独立目录，由产品或 CI 协调。"
msgstr ""
"Each build directory has one toolchain and assembly; Runtime and Platform "
"are mutually exclusive. One assembly may create multiple images, each owning"
" an independent startup OBJECT. Different boards or CPU/security domains use"
" separate directories, coordinated by the product or CI."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:68
msgid "当前实现位置"
msgstr "Current implementation locations"

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:70
msgid ""
"生产系列入口为 `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`：`facts/` 提供事实，`system/` "
"提供系统机制，`drivers/<domain>/` 保持 binding、实例布局与 C 实现相邻，`drivers/ip/` "
"复用已核验算法，`sdk/` 保持官方依赖和配置私有。Native 模型位于 `tests/support/native/`，需要显式 test "
"support。"
msgstr ""
"The production family entry is `soc/stm32/stm32f4/`: `facts/` supplies "
"facts; `system/` supplies system mechanisms; `drivers/<domain>/` keeps "
"bindings, instance layouts and C implementations adjacent; `drivers/ip/` "
"reuses reviewed algorithms; `sdk/` keeps official dependencies and "
"configuration private. Native models reside in `tests/support/native/` and "
"require explicit test support."

#: ../../../../../../docs/explanation/platform-architecture.md:72
msgid ""
"当前精确支持见[平台参考](../reference/platforms/support.md)，维护入口见[源码地图](../development/source-"
"map.md)。文件或厂商库存在，不建立另一个型号、模式或实板验证结论。"
msgstr ""
"See [platform reference](../reference/platforms/support.md) for exact "
"current support and the [source map](../development/source-map.md) for "
"maintenance entry points. A file or vendor library does not establish "
"another part, mode or physical validation result."
